Subject: Fetch approved models only from their approved revisions

Freecut MIT adaptation. Model weights, tokenizers and processors are
requested from the exact Hugging Face revision the owner approved for local
runtime (studio/rights-approval.json), never from a moving branch, so the
runtime resource admission can bind each download to the reviewed row.
Each TTS voice is admitted as its own reviewed resource before it is used,
and the Whisper worker admits its transformers runtime as well as its model.

